section.why#why(aria-labelledby="why-title")
  .container
    .section-head.text-center.animate-on-scroll
      p.section-eyebrow Benefits
      h2.section-title#why-title Why Choose Us
      p.section-text We provide full service at every step.
    .row.g-4
      .col-md-6.col-lg-3
        article.why-card.animate-on-scroll
          .why-card__icon(aria-hidden="true")
            i.bi.bi-shield-check
          h3 Trusted By Thousands
          p With over 1 million+ homes for sale available on the website, Houzing can match you with a house you will want to call home.
      .col-md-6.col-lg-3
        article.why-card.animate-on-scroll
          .why-card__icon(aria-hidden="true")
            i.bi.bi-houses
          h3 Wide Range Of Properties
          p From cozy studios to luxury villas — explore a curated catalog updated daily by verified agents.
      .col-md-6.col-lg-3
        article.why-card.animate-on-scroll
          .why-card__icon(aria-hidden="true")
            i.bi.bi-cash-coin
          h3 Financing Made Easy
          p Compare options and get guidance from specialists so buying or renting feels simple and transparent.
      .col-md-6.col-lg-3
        article.why-card.animate-on-scroll
          .why-card__icon(aria-hidden="true")
            i.bi.bi-geo
          h3 See Neighborhoods
          p Discover schools, parks, transit, and lifestyle insights for every listing you love.
